與我戍許","sourceLabel":"第 85 页","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注釋","excerpt":"許，亦姜姓之國，在今河南許昌境。","fullText":"許，亦姜姓之國，在今河南許昌境。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-016"]},{"id":"wangli-yundu:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/068-yang-zhi-shui/wangli-yundu/0001-1","materialId":"wangli-yundu","materialTitle":"詩經韻讀","contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","publicationYear":1980,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"扬之水，不流束薪，彼其之子，不与我戍申，怀哉怀哉，曷月予还归哉。","sourceLabel":"第 178 页局部","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","excerpt":"扬之水, 不流束薪(sien); 彼其之子, 不与我戍申(sjien)。（真部）怀(hoai)哉! 怀(hoai)哉! 曷月予还归(kiuoi)哉?（微部）","fullText":"扬之水, 不流束薪(sien); 彼其之子, 不与我戍申(sjien)。（真部）怀(hoai)哉! 怀(hoai)哉! 曷月予还归(kiuoi)哉?（微部）","notes":"据页图转写，保留拟音与韵部。","partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004","seg-005","seg-006"]},{"id":"wangli-yundu:0002-1:part-1","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/068-yang-zhi-shui/wangli-yundu/0002-1","materialId":"wangli-yundu","materialTitle":"詩經韻讀","contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","publicationYear":1980,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"扬之水，不流束楚，彼其之子，不与我戍甫，怀哉怀哉，曷月予还归哉。","sourceLabel":"第 178 页局部","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","excerpt":"扬之水, 不流束楚(tshia); 彼其之子, 不与我戍甫(piua)。（鱼部）怀(hoai)哉! 怀(hoai)哉! 曷月予还归(kiuoi)哉?（微部）","fullText":"扬之水, 不流束楚(tshia); 彼其之子, 不与我戍甫(piua)。（鱼部）怀(hoai)哉! 怀(hoai)哉! 曷月予还归(kiuoi)哉?（微部）","notes":"据页图转写，保留拟音与韵部。","partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-007","seg-008","seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012"]},{"id":"wangli-yundu:0003-1:part-1","annotationId":"0003","glossId":"0003-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/068-yang-zhi-shui/wangli-yundu/0003-1","materialId":"wangli-yundu","materialTitle":"詩經韻讀","contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","publicationYear":1980,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"扬之水，不流束蒲，彼其之子，不与我戍许，怀哉怀